OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FMillions of doses of pet flea
OL,7,Ftreatment are being applied
OL,8,Funnecessarily each year, potentially
OL,9,Fcausing widespread damage to the
OL,10,Fenvironment, peers have warned.
OL,12,FThe House of Lords Environment and
OL,13,FClimate Change Committee is calling
OL,14,Ffor a ban on the general sale of off-
OL,15,Fthe-shelf and unchecked online pet
OL,16,Ftreatments for fleas and ticks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FA new report from the committee said
OL,7,Fthe intensive overuse of veterinary
OL,8,Fmedications to treat for parasites
OL,9,Fsuch as fleas, ticks and worms in pets
OL,10,Fis not supported by robust scientific
OL,11,Fevidence.
OL,13,FIt warned the treatments are released
OL,14,Finto the environment from homes and
OL,15,Fare potentially causing widespread
OL,16,Fdamage to nature, in rivers and other
OL,17,Faquatic systems as well as on land.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FTwo of the key chemicals used in
OL,7,Ftreatments are fipronil and
OL,8,Fimidacloprid, which are banned for use
OL,9,Fas agricultural pesticides because of
OL,10,Ftheir impact on wildlife such as bees,
OL,11,Fwhile the committee said "very little
OL,12,Fis known" about the impacts of newer
OL,13,Fchemicals.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FThe peers said pet owners should
OL,7,Freceive a thorough assessment of their
OL,8,Fanimal's needs and advice about the
OL,9,Fpotential health and environmental
OL,10,Frisks of pet parasite treatments, with
OL,11,Fthe drugs only distributed through
OL,12,Fvets, pharmacists and appropriately
OL,13,Ftrained people.
OL,15,FThey also raised concerns about how
OL,16,Fclose the pet health industry is to
OL,17,Fthe regulatory and advice-setting
OL,18,Fframeworks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FThe peers called on the government to
OL,7,Festablish a clear and comprehensive
OL,8,Fevidence base on the use of the
OL,9,Ftreatments, and to ensure research
OL,10,Faddresses significant evidence gaps
OL,11,Fbetween environmental impacts and the
OL,12,Fpotential risks to human health.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FThey said there should be a more
OL,7,Fprecautionary approach to reduce the
OL,8,Fnumber of unnecessary treatments,
OL,9,Fparticularly for low-risk animals.
OL,11,FThis could include strengthening
OL,12,Fadvice on products and ensuring they
OL,13,Fcannot be sold without qualified
OL,14,Fadvice ` including online ` and making
OL,15,Frisks more visible on packaging.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FThe report also called for a review of
OL,7,Fthe relationship between the industry
OL,8,Fand UK and international veterinary
OL,9,Fmedicine regulators, to ensure
OL,10,Fappropriate and independent guidance
OL,11,Fis prioritised.
OL,13,FBaroness Sheehan, chairwoman of the
OL,14,Fcommittee, said: "Our report raises
OL,15,Fserious questions and concerns about
OL,16,Fthe environmental risks of pet flea
OL,17,Fand tick treatments as well as how
OL,18,Fthey are sold to pet owners.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,F"Their over-use on household pets is
OL,7,Fthe equivalent of using a sledgehammer
OL,8,Fto crack a nut."
OL,10,FBritish Veterinary Association (BVA)
OL,11,Fsenior vice president Dr Elizabeth
OL,12,FMullineaux, said: "Parasiticides, like
OL,13,Fflea treatments, are vital tools in
OL,14,Fpreventing, treating and protecting
OL,15,Fpeople and animals from disease and
OL,16,Frelated welfare issues.
OL,18,F"However, there's increasing evidence
OL,19,Fsome of these products are damaging to
OL,20,Fthe environment."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FShe said the report's recommendations
OL,7,Fwere in parallel with many of the
OL,8,FBVA's own.
OL,10,FGeorge Duncan Jones, biodiversity
OL,11,Fpolicy lead at Greenpeace UK, welcomed
OL,12,Fthe calls, saying that banning the
OL,13,Fsale of the toxic chemicals as part of
OL,14,Fover-the-counter flea treatments was
OL,15,F"long overdue".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FA Veterinary Medicines Directorate
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "We recognise that
OL,8,Fwhile pet parasite treatments play an
OL,9,Fimportant role in protecting pets and
OL,10,Fpeople from parasites and the diseases
OL,11,Fthey carry, they are entering our
OL,12,Fwatercourses, which could be
OL,13,Fcontributing to wider environmental
OL,14,Fimpacts.
OL,16,F"That's why we have consulted on this
OL,17,Fissue to help us maintain appropriate
OL,18,Fmarket availability of these
OL,19,Fsubstances while also protecting
OL,20,Fwildlife and the environment."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785925100
OL,3,CPeers call for ban on 'toxic' pet flea
OL,4,Ctreatments to protect environment
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Environment
OL,7,FDepartment (Defra) said: "This
OL,8,Fgovernment is committed to restoring
OL,9,Fnature and cleaning up our rivers
OL,10,Fwhilst upholding the highest animal
OL,11,Fwelfare standards.
OL,13,F"While these treatments play a vital
OL,14,Frole in public and pet health against
OL,15,Ffleas and ticks, it is right that we
OL,16,Fassess the availability of these
OL,17,Ftreatments to ensure correct usage by
OL,18,Fowners."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
